  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Kutbuddin M Hussain vs Food And Drugs Administration on 8 August, 2019 High Court Of Madhya Pradesh, Bench At Indore Criminal Revision No.650 Of",
    "facts": "Considering this aspect, IA No.2896/2019 which is an application for conversion of criminal revision into criminal appeal, a perusal of provision of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 (for short 'the Act of 2006') shows that against the order of Adjudicating Officer, an appeal lies before the Tribunal under Section 68(3) of the Act of 2006, the Adjudicating Officer has been shown to have the powers of a Civil Court. Under Section 71 of the Act of 2006, the Tribunal has been shown to have powers of a Civil Court as well.",
